--><div class="mw-collapsible mw-collapsed" id="mw-customcollapsible-update"><poem>
■ Added a friend invitation feature
When an invited friend clears specific missions, both players receive rewards
※The feature is available after clearing [[Cambodia (Empire of Cats)|Cambodia/Miyazaki]] in Empire of Cats Chapter 1
※Missions will be displayed after entering an invitation code
※Invitation codes can only be from players within 7 days of starting the game
■ Added an [[Kalisa (Uber Rare Cat)|Ultra Form]]
■ Added Talents and Ultra Talents to some characters
■ Added a [[ZL 38|new map]] to Legend Stages and higher difficulties on existing maps
■ Miscellaneous
New User Rank rewards
New Cat Combos
Light feature improvements
■ Bug fixes
</poem></div><!--
