■ Treasure Gauge added!
Clear a stage for a guaranteed Superior Treasure when the Treasure Gauge is filled up!
The gauge can be filled by various means such as clearing stages.
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Only available for stages with Treasures.
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Stages unrelated to Treasures will also fill the gauge.
■ New True Forms/Ultra Forms
■ New Talents/Ultra Talents
■ New Legend Map/Stage Difficulties/Rank Rewards/CatCombos
■ Minor Bug Fixes and Feature Revisions
